#, no-wrap
msgid "The example circuit uses an instance of [`efficient_su2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.efficient_su2) from Qiskit's circuit library.\n"
msgstr "Circuit contoh menggunakan instans [`efficient_su2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.efficient_su2) dari perpustakaan Circuit Qiskit.\n"

